    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32207" root="غلب" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغْلَنْبٍ</span></b>  One <i>who overcomes, conquers,</i> or <i>subdues,
another; who gains ascendency,</i> or <i>the mastery,
over him:</i> (K, TA:) it is quasi coordinate to
[<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحْرَنْجِمٌ</span>, part. n. of] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِحْرَنْجَمَ</span> [which is from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرْجَمَ</span>]. (TA.)

